 a + c = 2a + c + b,$  this gives us the largest possible value for exponents of k and thus gives us the largest value for k is a positive value. \n\nאינטרכול\nELCOME Thank you for the tips, but I must apologize. The initial math problem and the result from it seems incorrect, and is pointing the answer to be less than 16 and not 16%.\nJSGlobalScope stay\nعبرinquiry 整理\ninline整理回存ask\nсредiece territoryدخلڑ",
